{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>..:: A Turnbased Survival RPG ::..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each turn\u00a0you must make choices - Spend your Actions Points well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The swamp might overwhelm you, or you might live long enough to become a hardened survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f67db222c5cbb024387a3c7c0273dadc.poster.avif?t=1764944799\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f67db222c5cbb024387a3c7c0273dadc.webm?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f67db222c5cbb024387a3c7c0273dadc.mp4?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While nature itself will be a  challenge, the foes you encounter will be formidable as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The combat will be unique and puzzlelike.\u00a0 Weapons will have different attack patterns and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/ddd8d51001b85c5f8ab597cb33309e2a.poster.avif?t=1764944799\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/ddd8d51001b85c5f8ab597cb33309e2a.webm?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/ddd8d51001b85c5f8ab597cb33309e2a.mp4?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nights are cold and dangerous. A thick tree will provide some shelter against the elements. The journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> and the atmospheric exploration are equally as important as the destinations themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f8280222050dea97f585359708029454.poster.avif?t=1764944799\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f8280222050dea97f585359708029454.webm?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f8280222050dea97f585359708029454.mp4?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Mirk is a living place. You will be create paths, set up camps, discover ancient ruins and mysteries, all while meeting unique characters and beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/5dd2891cf9d6aaf7138372684845f15c.poster.avif?t=1764944799\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/5dd2891cf9d6aaf7138372684845f15c.webm?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/5dd2891cf9d6aaf7138372684845f15c.mp4?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will feature:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mechanics: Hunger, Focus/Tiredness, Energy and Warmth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic RPG mechanics with skills, abilities, and a wide variety of items, armor and gear. The survival mechanics will play a large part here as well: Your steel chestplate will be great for combat, but not for climbing\u00a0or keeping warm. Skills will allow for a variety of playstyles: from foraging the land, brewing and selling potions, hunting, exploring and looting, to trading, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated terrain, creating unique playthrough while still integrating handcrafted location, characters and events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique world with interesting lore, enemies, discoveries, and an eerie atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom of choice: An optional main story with a decent amount of challenges and quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lastly: <i>This game is under development - details, screenshots and videos will added and/or changed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Please note:</strong> This game is meant to be challenging. You are expected to lose many times, and it will take time to learn how to survive. Dungeons will not be amusement rides designed for the player, but dangerous trials that demand careful preparation. To sum it up: <i>Losing your last torch in pitch darkness won\u2019t be <strong>fun</strong> \u2014 but it should be <strong>memorable</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972980?t=1764944799","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972980?t=1764944799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/2eb09d138c71e4bd57320e5c346b31de036d5ba4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764944799","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/2eb09d138c71e4bd57320e5c346b31de036d5ba4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764944799","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>..:: A Turnbased Survival RPG ::..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each turn\u00a0you must make choices - Spend your Actions Points well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The swamp might overwhelm you, or you might live long enough to become a hardened survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f67db222c5cbb024387a3c7c0273dadc.poster.avif?t=1764944799\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f67db222c5cbb024387a3c7c0273dadc.webm?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f67db222c5cbb024387a3c7c0273dadc.mp4?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While nature itself will be a  challenge, the foes you encounter will be formidable as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The combat will be unique and puzzlelike.\u00a0 Weapons will have different attack patterns and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/ddd8d51001b85c5f8ab597cb33309e2a.poster.avif?t=1764944799\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/ddd8d51001b85c5f8ab597cb33309e2a.webm?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/ddd8d51001b85c5f8ab597cb33309e2a.mp4?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nights are cold and dangerous. A thick tree will provide some shelter against the elements. The journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> and the atmospheric exploration are equally as important as the destinations themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f8280222050dea97f585359708029454.poster.avif?t=1764944799\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f8280222050dea97f585359708029454.webm?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/f8280222050dea97f585359708029454.mp4?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Mirk is a living place. You will be create paths, set up camps, discover ancient ruins and mysteries, all while meeting unique characters and beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/5dd2891cf9d6aaf7138372684845f15c.poster.avif?t=1764944799\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/5dd2891cf9d6aaf7138372684845f15c.webm?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/extras/5dd2891cf9d6aaf7138372684845f15c.mp4?t=1764944799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will feature:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mechanics: Hunger, Focus/Tiredness, Energy and Warmth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic RPG mechanics with skills, abilities, and a wide variety of items, armor and gear. The survival mechanics will play a large part here as well: Your steel chestplate will be great for combat, but not for climbing\u00a0or keeping warm. Skills will allow for a variety of playstyles: from foraging the land, brewing and selling potions, hunting, exploring and looting, to trading, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated terrain, creating unique playthrough while still integrating handcrafted location, characters and events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique world with interesting lore, enemies, discoveries, and an eerie atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom of choice: An optional main story with a decent amount of challenges and quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lastly: <i>This game is under development - details, screenshots and videos will added and/or changed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Please note:</strong> This game is meant to be challenging. You are expected to lose many times, and it will take time to learn how to survive. Dungeons will not be amusement rides designed for the player, but dangerous trials that demand careful preparation. To sum it up: <i>Losing your last torch in pitch darkness won\u2019t be <strong>fun</strong> \u2014 but it should be <strong>memorable</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Edym Pixels"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/c7a6790363e9dff712e3e820b4a278593577d4e3/header.jpg?t=1764944799","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"This game has been made by Mattias Myde, Edym Pixels \u00a9. It has been made with GameMaker Studio 2.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3972980/1190051910/4c8bdcce31dec93e6ab892ba07afa156909b8733/1760100592/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760101263","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3972980/1190051910/4c8bdcce31dec93e6ab892ba07afa156909b8733/1760100592/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760101263","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3972980/1190051910/4c8bdcce31dec93e6ab892ba07afa156909b8733/1760100592/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760101263","id":257215652,"name":"Mirklurk - Combat Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257215652/9ddb3dbd327356fba2b7f7f6712380ab18ccdb9b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760101263"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3972980/1960174830/99b91ada561a9880600122831231dcc491812e28/1759590972/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759592833","dash_h264