972980/f43b4dfe50bb78bf33a418d0cc7c95c5d5d82790/ss_f43b4dfe50bb78bf33a418d0cc7c95c5d5d82790.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764944799","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972980/f43b4dfe50bb78bf33a418d0cc7c95c5d5d82790/ss_f43b4dfe50bb78bf33a418d0cc7c95c5d5d82790.600x338.jpg?t=1764944799"}],"short_description":"You have been exiled to The Mirk - an unforgiving swampland where every step can be your last. You must constantly make choices: what paths to take, which tree to shelter under, what beasts to engage or avoid, what items to bring into the darkness of dungeons, and what to leave behind.","steam_appid":3972980,"support_info":{"email":"mattias@edympixels.com","url":"https://edympixels.com/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://edympixels.com/"}